 "sections": [
  {
   "id": "visual-theme-atmosphere",
   "title": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "Tema visual e atmosfera"
    }
   ],
   "html": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "<p>Coinbase's website is a clean, trustworthy crypto platform that communicates financial reliability through a blue-and-white binary palette. The design uses Coinbase Blue (<code>#0052ff</code>) — a deep, saturated blue — as the singular brand accent against white and near-black surfaces. The proprietary font family includes CoinbaseDisplay for hero headlines, CoinbaseSans for UI text, CoinbaseText for body reading, and CoinbaseIcons for iconography — a comprehensive four-font system.</p>\n<p>The button system uses a distinctive 56px radius for pill-shaped CTAs with hover transitions to a lighter blue (<code>#578bfa</code>). The design alternates between white content sections and dark (<code>#0a0b0d</code>, <code>#282b31</code>) feature sections, creating a professional, financial-grade interface.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Characteristics:</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Coinbase Blue (<code>#0052ff</code>) as singular brand accent</li><li>Four-font proprietary family: Display, Sans, Text, Icons</li><li>56px radius pill buttons with blue hover transition</li><li>Near-black (<code>#0a0b0d</code>) dark sections + white light sections</li><li>1.00 line-height on display headings — ultra-tight</li><li>Cool gray secondary surface (<code>#eef0f3</code>) with blue tint</li><li><code>text-transform: lowercase</code> on some button labels — unusual</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "<p>O site da Coinbase é uma plataforma cripto limpa e confiável, que comunica solidez financeira por meio de uma paleta binária de azul e branco. O design usa o Coinbase Blue (<code>#0052ff</code>) — um azul profundo e saturado — como único destaque da marca sobre superfícies brancas e quase pretas. A família tipográfica proprietária inclui a CoinbaseDisplay para títulos de hero, a CoinbaseSans para texto de interface, a CoinbaseText para leitura e a CoinbaseIcons para a iconografia — um sistema completo de quatro fontes.</p>\n<p>O sistema de botões usa um raio característico de 56px para CTAs em formato de pílula, com transição no hover para um azul mais claro (<code>#578bfa</code>). O design alterna seções de conteúdo brancas com seções de recursos escuras (<code>#0a0b0d</code>, <code>#282b31</code>), criando uma interface profissional, de padrão financeiro.</p>\n<p><strong>Características principais:</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Coinbase Blue (<code>#0052ff</code>) como único destaque da marca</li><li>Família proprietária de quatro fontes: Display, Sans, Text, Icons</li><li>Botões em pílula com raio de 56px e transição azul no hover</li><li>Seções escuras quase pretas (<code>#0a0b0d</code>) + seções claras brancas</li><li>Altura de linha 1.00 nos títulos de display — extremamente justa</li><li>Superfície secundária cinza fria (<code>#eef0f3</code>) com toque azulado</li><li><code>text-transform: lowercase</code> em alguns rótulos de botão — algo incomum</li></ul>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "color-palette-roles",
   "title": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "Color Palette & Roles"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "Paleta de cores e papéis"
    }
   ],
   "html": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "<h3>Primary</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Coinbase Blue</strong> (<code>#0052ff</code>): Primary brand, links, CTA borders</li><li><strong>Pure White</strong> (<code>#ffffff</code>): Primary light surface</li><li><strong>Near Black</strong> (<code>#0a0b0d</code>): Text, dark section backgrounds</li><li><strong>Cool Gray Surface</strong> (<code>#eef0f3</code>): Secondary button background</li></ul>\n<h3>Interactive</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Hover Blue</strong> (<code>#578bfa</code>): Button hover background</li><li><strong>Link Blue</strong> (<code>#0667d0</code>): Secondary link color</li><li><strong>Muted Blue</strong> (<code>#5b616e</code>): Border color at 20% opacity</li></ul>\n<h3>Surface</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Dark Card</strong> (<code>#282b31</code>): Dark button/card backgrounds</li><li><strong>Light Surface</strong> (<code>rgba(247,247,247,0.88)</code>): Subtle surface</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "<h3>Primárias</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Coinbase Blue</strong> (<code>#0052ff</code>): cor principal da marca, links, bordas de CTAs</li><li><strong>Pure White</strong> (<code>#ffffff</code>): superfície clara principal</li><li><strong>Near Black</strong> (<code>#0a0b0d</code>): texto, fundos das seções escuras</li><li><strong>Cool Gray Surface</strong> (<code>#eef0f3</code>): fundo de botões secundários</li></ul>\n<h3>Interativas</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Hover Blue</strong> (<code>#578bfa</code>): fundo de botões no hover</li><li><strong>Link Blue</strong> (<code>#0667d0</code>): cor de links secundários</li><li><strong>Muted Blue</strong> (<code>#5b616e</code>): cor de borda a 20% de opacidade</li></ul>\n<h3>Superfícies</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Dark Card</strong> (<code>#282b31</code>): fundos escuros de botões/cards</li><li><strong>Light Surface</strong> (<code>rgba(247,247,247,0.88)</code>): superfície sutil</li></ul>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "typography-rules",
   "title": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "Typography Rules"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "Regras de tipografia"
    }
   ],
   "html": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "<h3>Font Families</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Display</strong>: <code>CoinbaseDisplay</code> — hero headlines</li><li><strong>UI / Sans</strong>: <code>CoinbaseSans</code> — buttons, headings, nav</li><li><strong>Body</strong>: <code>CoinbaseText</code> — reading text</li><li><strong>Icons</strong>: <code>CoinbaseIcons</code> — icon font</li></ul>\n<h3>Hierarchy</h3>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>Font</th><th>Size</th><th>Weight</th><th>Line Height</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Hero</td><td>CoinbaseDisplay</td><td>80px</td><td>400</td><td>1.00 (tight)</td><td>Maximum impact</td></tr><tr><td>Display Secondary</td><td>CoinbaseDisplay</td><td>64px</td><td>400</td><td>1.00</td><td>Sub-hero</td></tr><tr><td>Display Third</td><td>CoinbaseDisplay</td><td>52px</td><td>400</td><td>1.00</td><td>Third tier</td></tr><tr><td>Section Heading</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>36px</td><td>400</td><td>1.11 (tight)</td><td>Feature sections</td></tr><tr><td>Card Title</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>32px</td><td>400</td><td>1.13</td><td>Card headings</td></tr><tr><td>Feature Title</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>18px</td><td>600</td><td>1.33</td><td>Feature emphasis</td></tr><tr><td>Body Bold</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>16px</td><td>700</td><td>1.50</td><td>Strong body</td></tr><tr><td>Body Semibold</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>16px</td><td>600</td><td>1.25</td><td>Buttons, nav</td></tr><tr><td>Body</td><td>CoinbaseText</td><td>18px</td><td>400</td><td>1.56</td><td>Standard reading</td></tr><tr><td>Body Small</td><td>CoinbaseText</td><td>16px</td><td>400</td><td>1.50</td><td>Secondary reading</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>16px</td><td>600</td><td>1.20</td><td>+0.16px tracking</td></tr><tr><td>Caption</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>14px</td><td>600–700</td><td>1.50</td><td>Metadata</td></tr><tr><td>Small</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>13px</td><td>600</td><td>1.23</td><td>Tags</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "<h3>Famílias tipográficas</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Display</strong>: <code>CoinbaseDisplay</code> — títulos de hero</li><li><strong>Interface / Sans</strong>: <code>CoinbaseSans</code> — botões, títulos, navegação</li><li><strong>Corpo</strong>: <code>CoinbaseText</code> — texto de leitura</li><li><strong>Ícones</strong>: <code>CoinbaseIcons</code> — fonte de ícones</li></ul>\n<h3>Hierarquia</h3>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Papel</th><th>Fonte</th><th>Tamanho</th><th>Peso</th><th>Altura da linha</th><th>Observações</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Hero</td><td>CoinbaseDisplay</td><td>80px</td><td>400</td><td>1.00 (justa)</td><td>Impacto máximo</td></tr><tr><td>Display secundário</td><td>CoinbaseDisplay</td><td>64px</td><td>400</td><td>1.00</td><td>Sub-hero</td></tr><tr><td>Display terciário</td><td>CoinbaseDisplay</td><td>52px</td><td>400</td><td>1.00</td><td>Terceiro nível</td></tr><tr><td>Título de seção</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>36px</td><td>400</td><td>1.11 (justa)</td><td>Seções de recursos</td></tr><tr><td>Título de card</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>32px</td><td>400</td><td>1.13</td><td>Títulos de cards</td></tr><tr><td>Título de recurso</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>18px</td><td>600</td><td>1.33</td><td>Ênfase em recursos</td></tr><tr><td>Corpo negrito</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>16px</td><td>700</td><td>1.50</td><td>Corpo forte</td></tr><tr><td>Corpo seminegrito</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>16px</td><td>600</td><td>1.25</td><td>Botões, navegação</td></tr><tr><td>Corpo</td><td>CoinbaseText</td><td>18px</td><td>400</td><td>1.56</td><td>Leitura padrão</td></tr><tr><td>Corpo pequeno</td><td>CoinbaseText</td><td>16px</td><td>400</td><td>1.50</td><td>Leitura secundária</td></tr><tr><td>Botão</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>16px</td><td>600</td><td>1.20</td><td>Tracking de +0.16px</td></tr><tr><td>Legenda</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>14px</td><td>600–700</td><td>1.50</td><td>Metadados</td></tr><tr><td>Pequeno</td><td>CoinbaseSans</td><td>13px</td><td>600</td><td>1.23</td><td>Tags</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "component-stylings",
   "title": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "Component Stylings"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "Estilo dos componentes"
    }
   ],
   "html": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "<h3>Buttons</h3>\n<p><strong>Primary Pill (56px radius)</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Background: <code>#eef0f3</code> or <code>#282b31</code></li><li>Radius: 56px</li><li>Border: <code>1px solid</code> matching background</li><li>Hover: <code>#578bfa</code> (light blue)</li><li>Focus: <code>2px solid black</code> outline</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Full Pill (100000px radius)</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Used for maximum pill shape</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Blue Bordered</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Border: <code>1px solid #0052ff</code></li><li>Background: transparent</li></ul>\n<h3>Cards &amp; Containers</h3>\n<ul><li>Radius: 8px–40px range</li><li>Borders: <code>1px solid rgba(91,97,110,0.2)</code></li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "<h3>Botões</h3>\n<p><strong>Pílula primária (raio de 56px)</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Fundo: <code>#eef0f3</code> ou <code>#282b31</code></li><li>Raio: 56px</li><li>Borda: <code>1px solid</code> na mesma cor do fundo</li><li>Hover: <code>#578bfa</code> (azul claro)</li><li>Foco: contorno <code>2px solid black</code></li></ul>\n<p><strong>Pílula completa (raio de 100000px)</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Usada para o formato de pílula máximo</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Borda azul</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Borda: <code>1px solid #0052ff</code></li><li>Fundo: transparente</li></ul>\n<h3>Cards e contêineres</h3>\n<ul><li>Raio: faixa de 8px–40px</li><li>Bordas: <code>1px solid rgba(91,97,110,0.2)</code></li></ul>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "layout-principles",
   "title": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "Layout Principles"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "Princípios de layout"
    }
   ],
   "html": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "<h3>Spacing System</h3>\n<ul><li>Base: 8px</li><li>Scale: 1px, 3px, 4px, 5px, 6px, 8px, 10px, 12px, 15px, 16px, 20px, 24px, 25px, 32px, 48px</li></ul>\n<h3>Border Radius Scale</h3>\n<ul><li>Small (4px–8px): Article links, small cards</li><li>Standard (12px–16px): Cards, menus</li><li>Large (24px–32px): Feature containers</li><li>XL (40px): Large buttons/containers</li><li>Pill (56px): Primary CTAs</li><li>Full (100000px): Maximum pill</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "<h3>Sistema de espaçamento</h3>\n<ul><li>Base: 8px</li><li>Escala: 1px, 3px, 4px, 5px, 6px, 8px, 10px, 12px, 15px, 16px, 20px, 24px, 25px, 32px, 48px</li></ul>\n<h3>Escala de raios de borda</h3>\n<ul><li>Pequeno (4px–8px): links de artigos, cards pequenos</li><li>Padrão (12px–16px): cards, menus</li><li>Grande (24px–32px): contêineres de recursos</li><li>XL (40px): botões/contêineres grandes</li><li>Pílula (56px): CTAs principais</li><li>Completo (100000px): pílula máxima</li></ul>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
