  {
   "id": "agent-prompt-guide",
   "title": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "Agent Prompt Guide"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "Guia de prompts para agentes"
    }
   ],
   "html": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "<h3>Quick Color Reference</h3>\n<ul><li>Brand: Coinbase Blue (<code>#0052ff</code>)</li><li>Background: White (<code>#ffffff</code>)</li><li>Dark surface: <code>#0a0b0d</code></li><li>Secondary surface: <code>#eef0f3</code></li><li>Hover: <code>#578bfa</code></li><li>Text: <code>#0a0b0d</code></li></ul>\n<h3>Example Component Prompts</h3>\n<ul><li>&quot;Create hero: white background. CoinbaseDisplay 80px, line-height 1.00. Pill CTA (#eef0f3, 56px radius). Hover: #578bfa.&quot;</li><li>&quot;Build dark section: #0a0b0d background. CoinbaseDisplay 64px white text. Blue accent link (#0052ff).&quot;</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "<h3>Referência rápida de cores</h3>\n<ul><li>Marca: Coinbase Blue (<code>#0052ff</code>)</li><li>Fundo: White (<code>#ffffff</code>)</li><li>Superfície escura: <code>#0a0b0d</code></li><li>Superfície secundária: <code>#eef0f3</code></li><li>Hover: <code>#578bfa</code></li><li>Texto: <code>#0a0b0d</code></li></ul>\n<h3>Exemplos de prompts de componentes</h3>\n<ul><li>&quot;Crie um hero: fundo branco. CoinbaseDisplay 80px, line-height 1.00. CTA em pílula (#eef0f3, raio de 56px). Hover: #578bfa.&quot;</li><li>&quot;Construa uma seção escura: fundo #0a0b0d. CoinbaseDisplay 64px em texto branco. Link de destaque azul (#0052ff).&quot;</li></ul>"
    }
   ]
